nsylvania where I challenged students to create a startup from scratch in four days. Most of the people in the class were in the executive MBA program, so they were taking classes while also working as doctors, managers, or leaders in a variety of large and small companies. Few had ever coded. …</p><p>URL: <a href="https://www.oneusefulthing.org/p/management-as-ai-superpower?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://www.oneusefulthing.org/p/management-as-ai-superpower?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/ai-links-1292026">AI Links, 1/29/2026</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.oneusefulthing.org/p/management-as-ai-superpower?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.oneusefulthing.org/p/management-as-ai-superpower?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 13:03:37 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Claude Codes #3]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>We’re back with all the Claude that’s fit to Code. I continue to have great fun with it and find useful upgrades, but the biggest reminder is that you need the art to have an end other than itself. Don’t spend too long improving your setup, or especially improving how you improve your setup, without actually working on useful things…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://thezvi.substack.com/p/claude-codes-3?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://thezvi.substack.com/p/claude-codes-3?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/ai-links-1292026">AI Links, 1/29/2026</a></p>]]></description><link>https://thezvi.substack.com/p/claude-codes-3?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://thezvi.substack.com/p/claude-codes-3?utm_sour